  [1mThe consequence:[0m [38;5;153mclient.py[39m is the shared client for both scripts. [38;5;153mscripts/export_prod.py[39m imports the same
  [38;5;153mfetch_report[39m/[38;5;153mlist_reports[39m and points them at [38;5;153mhttps://reports.example.com[39m (production, real CA-signed cert). Setting
